/div><span class=\"mv num\">59</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">MFI</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:30.0%; width:40.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:70.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:80.0%; width:20.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:63.1%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">63</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ADX(トレンド強さ)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:8.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:41.7%; width:58.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:13.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">8↑</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">一目・雲</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:33.3%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:33.3%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:66.7%; width:33.3%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:83.3%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">雲の上</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">ATR(日々の値幅)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.0%; width:15.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:35.0%; width:15.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:17.4%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">1.7%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">HV(年率変動)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:20.8%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:20.8%; width:12.5%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:33.3%; width:16.7%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:50.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:18.7%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">22%</span></div><div class=\"mrow\"><span class=\"ml\">OBV(20日)</span><div class=\"mtrack\"><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:0.0%; width:40.0%; background:#f2c4a8\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:40.0%; width:10.0%; background:#f5e6b3\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:50.0%; width:10.0%; background:#eeeae0\"></div><div class=\"mz\" style=\"left:60.0%; width:40.0%; background:#b9dcc0\"></div><div class=\"mpin\" style=\"left:100.0%\"></div></div><span class=\"mv num\">+92%</span></div></div><div class=\"discnote\">ピンが現在値。PER・PBRなど価値系は「標準」が最も安心、割安は魅力だが「割安の罠」の確認が必要。RSI・ボリンジャーなど行きすぎ系は売られすぎ側が押し目買いに有利。読み方は「指標の読み方」ページへ。</div><div class=\"nhead\">スコア 96点（候補圏外）</div><div class=\"reason\">・直近20日高値から −1.9%（安さの主基準 +15点・8%で頭打ち）</div><div class=\"reason\">・下げの大半が特定の1日に集中（急落型・加点なし）</div><div class=\"reason\">・日々の値動きが±1.4%と穏やかで読みやすい（+10点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・200日平均線より上での下げ＝上昇トレンド中の一時的な押し目（+20点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・1年高値からの下落 −13% で長期トレンド健全（+12点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・1年の値幅の中腹（下から54%）での下げ。底抜けでも高値掴みでもない位置（+10点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・過去1年、同じ買い方で 2回 利確ライン（+5%）に到達（+10点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・利確まで平均 36営業日と資金拘束が長め。短期回転スタイルでは機会損失（−5点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・ただし直近の仮想買いが塩漬け中（−15点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・長期支持帯 1,820円付近は過去11回試されており、今回で12回目。支持線は試されるほど割れやすい（−5点・警戒）</div><div class=\"reason\">・50日線が200日線の上（ゴールデンクロス継続中の長期上昇形 +10点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・MACDがシグナル線の上で上向き（+4点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・一目均衡表の雲の上（中期の地合いは良好 +4点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・OBVが上向き＝下げの中でも買い集めの気配（+3点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・ATR 1.7%と日々の値幅が小さく、損切り幅を狭く置ける（+3点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・ファンダ指標が本日取得できず中立扱い（加減点なし）</div><div class=\"reason\">・夜間ギャップ（翌朝の窓開け）平均±0.6%と小さく、夜に決めた指値が翌朝も有効に働きやすい（+8点）</div><div class=\"reason\">・1日平均 15億円の売買があり注文が通りやすい（+12点）</div><div class=\"nhead\">減点方式: 全体632位（−16点）</div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>下げが1日に集中（崩落型）<span class=\"num hp\">−6</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>利確まで平均36日と資金拘束が長い<span class=\"num hp\">−5</span></div><div class=\"hit\"><span class=\"sev sevC\">軽い</span>直近の仮想買いが塩漬け中<span class=\"num hp\">−5</span></div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 3)\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 10)\">10年</button></span></div><div class=\"spark sp3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"61.9\" width=\"320\" height=\"12.399999999999999\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,38.8 6.1,42.5 8.3,36.4 10.4,38.6 12.5,45.6 14.7,53.5 16.8,56.2 19.0,58.5 21.1,73.0 23.2,69.1 25.4,74.6 27.5,73.6 29.6,67.2 31.8,67.4 33.9,63.6 36.1,66.2 38.2,67.8 40.3,59.1 42.5,62.9 44.6,58.4 46.7,59.6 48.9,58.2 51.0,50.3 53.2,51.6 55.3,60.4 57.4,69.0 59.6,67.8 61.7,72.1 63.8,74.9 66.0,66.7 68.1,65.0 70.2,63.7 72.4,63.0 74.5,66.5 76.7,73.5 78.8,68.6 80.9,70.7 83.1,77.5 85.2,82.9 87.3,82.4 89.5,80.7 91.6,84.2 93.8,81.0 95.9,81.3 98.0,83.3 100.2,85.7 102.3,88.0 104.4,95.2 106.6,97.2 108.7,79.2 110.8,75.4 113.0,70.3 115.1,69.4 117.3,65.4 119.4,67.7 121.5,68.8 123.7,58.3 125.8,59.8 127.9,60.9 130.1,52.9 132.2,55.7 134.4,59.9 136.5,62.8 138.6,64.3 140.8,66.4 142.9,59.2 145.0,23.8 147.2,23.5 149.3,38.4 151.5,51.3 153.6,43.8 155.7,38.7 157.9,33.6 160.0,39.2 162.1,42.7 164.3,41.9 166.4,47.8 168.5,39.3 170.7,38.9 172.8,43.7 175.0,61.5 177.1,54.2 179.2,38.2 181.4,41.6 183.5,40.9 185.6,43.3 187.8,49.1 189.9,54.2 192.1,59.3 194.2,62.7 196.3,63.7 198.5,58.9 200.6,54.0